<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/achievement_jadeserpent.jpg");'></span>Pre-Raid Opening</div>
<b>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_jadeserpent.gif");'></span>Pre-Raid Opening</b></a></li>
