<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This is an example of the Best in Slot gear available from all PvE sources available before entering a raid. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift.<br/>
<br/>It's also relevant to note, that although the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=82859/headmasters-will">
<img alt="Headmaster's Will" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Headmaster's Will</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87550/vithrak-gaze-of-the-deadman">
<img alt="Vithrak, Gaze of the Deadman" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vithrak, Gaze of the Deadman</span></a> items are listed in the following set - they're somewhat rare, make sure to use them if you can within the sets that are listed below. But if you can't get them, I advise using the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=81253/firescribe-dagger">
<img alt="Firescribe Dagger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firescribe Dagger</span></a> alongside the Inscription <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79334/inscribed-jade-fan">
<img alt="Inscribed Jade Fan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_1h_pandariatradeskill_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscribed Jade Fan</span></a>, or the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=81079/staff-of-trembling-will">
<img alt="Staff of Trembling Will" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_2h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Trembling Will</span></a> Staff to replace the Epic Weapon; and use the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=81560/signet-of-the-hidden-door">
<img alt="Signet of the Hidden Door" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_152.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Hidden Door</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=81141/alemental-seal">
<img alt="Alemental Seal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_141.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Alemental Seal</span></a> to replace the Epic Dungeon Ring.<br/>
<br/>
