<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-msv-release" role="tabpanel" style="display: none;" tabindex="0">This is an example of the Best in Slot gear available from all PvE sources after the Celestial Dungeons correspondent to Mogu'Shan Vault LFR gear are made available. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift.<br/>
