<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c8" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Frost Mages</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. This includes Rare Mobs, like <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50338/kornas-nightsavage">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kor'nas Nightsavage</span></a>, but also World Bosses such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon-warbands">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c8" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon and Salyis' Warband</span></h3>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Galleon</span></a> is one of two available world bosses in Phase 1, it provides a few great items for Frost Mage, but due to how inconsistent they are to obtain they weren't listed on the sets above, but they worthwhile gearing around if you obtain them.<br/>
<br/>
<b>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Galleon</span></a></b>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90449/belt-of-detonation">
<img alt="Belt of Detonation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidwarlock_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Detonation</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90439/open-steppe-sandals">
<img alt="Open Steppe Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_bracer_raidmage_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Open Steppe Sandals</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90418/robes-of-the-lightning-rider">
<img alt="Robes of the Lightning Rider" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_robe_raidmage_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of the Lightning Rider</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90409/sky-sear-cowl">
<img alt="Sky-Sear Cowl" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_cloth_raidwarlock_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sky-Sear Cowl</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90435/ring-of-wretched-flames">
<img alt="Ring of Wretched Flames" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Wretched Flames</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90429/necklace-of-imbued-fury">
<img alt="Necklace of Imbued Fury" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_95.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of Imbued Fury</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c8" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger is notable in that it drops item level 496 Tier 14 Legs and Gloves, as well as various item level 483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a headstart on your Tier set if you get lucky. <br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90913/sandals-of-the-shadow">
<img alt="Sandals of the Shadow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Shadow</span></a>, a decent pair of early Boots.<br/>
<br/>It's also relevant to note that from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>, the PvP gear can actually be a PVE upgrade for some slots depending on what gear you're currently using - using the <a href="https://www.wowsims.com/mop/mage/frost/#" target="_blank">Frost Sim</a> is a great way of finding out.<br/>
<br/>
<b>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a></b>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=85378/gloves-of-the-burning-scroll">
<img alt="Gloves of the Burning Scroll" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_raidmage_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of the Burning Scroll</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=85376/leggings-of-the-burning-scroll">
<img alt="Leggings of the Burning Scroll" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_raidmage_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Burning Scroll</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="rare-mobs">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c8" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Rare Mobs</span></h3>There are tons of Rare mobs scattered around Pandaria, and each one has their own unique drop. Most of these are toys, cosmetics, or similar items, but a small handful can drop strong equipment.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50338/kornas-nightsavage">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kor'nas Nightsavage</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87642/darkstaff-of-annihilation">
<img alt="Darkstaff of Annihilation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_2h_pandung_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkstaff of Annihilation</span></a>, a ilvl 420 Weapon</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50768/cournith-waterstrider">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Cournith Waterstrider</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90721/cournith-waterstriders-silken-finery">
<img alt="Cournith Waterstrider's Silken Finery" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cournith Waterstrider's Silken Finery</span></a>, ilvl 440 Leggings</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c8" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Frost Mages</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first.<br/>
<br/>As a Frost Mage, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Klaxxi</span></a> to get your hands on the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89062/klaxxi-lash-of-the-orator">
<img alt="Klaxxi Lash of the Orator" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Klaxxi Lash of the Orator</span></a> at Honored. Additionally, if you manage to hit Exalted before you manage to get a better ring, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90859/seal-of-the-lucid">
<img alt="Seal of the Lucid" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_147.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of the Lucid</span></a> is a great option to use.<br/>Otherwise, getting Honored with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a> will allow you to get the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89340/mantle-of-the-golden-sun">
<img alt="Mantle of the Golden Sun" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of the Golden Sun</span></a>, as well as the Tailoring recipes for the Spelltwister gloves and chest. These two are the best Valor pieces for your early gearing progress. Additionally, if you get Exalted with this same reputation, you then get access to a 389 item level necklace without need of Valor, and it's easily pre-raid best in slot, even above the Celestial Dungeon stuff.<br/>
<br/>Because the Valor you can obtain is capped until said cap increases, you realistically can't buy much before your first raid - so these two are the main things to aim for initially.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-klaxxi">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c8" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_klaxxi.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> The Klaxxi</span></h3>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table class="exclude-units grid" style="width: 900px; max-width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<b>Reputation</b></td>
<td>
<b>Item</b></td>
<td>
<b>Price</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>
<span class="rep-honored">Honored</span></td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89062/klaxxi-lash-of-the-orator">
